{
  "bodyHash": "+xB4vZqBb2Q=",
  "content": "<!--suppress HtmlDeprecatedAttribute -->\n\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center; font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif\">\n\n<p><img width=\"836\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/banner.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors\">\n<img alt=\"Github\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">\n<img alt=\"透過 Crowdin 翻譯\"\nsrc=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>\nImmersive Armors 為遊戲添加了許多與原版風格一致且獨特的盔甲套裝。與無聊的複製貼上盔甲不同，Immersive Armors 專注於視覺上更豐富的盔甲，有些還附帶披風或自訂模型。大多數盔甲擁有專屬效果，如狂暴模式、反彈、尖刺、神聖保護等。合成配方已正確收錄於原版配方書中。附魔、修復、染色等功能皆如預期般運作。\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>已有 40 種新盔甲物品，且持續增加！</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_armors%3Aarmor&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的圖集圖片\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>木製盔甲</h1>\n<p>我不敢說你，但我已經厭倦了被骷髏偷襲。這套原始但有效的盔甲提供了相當好的箭矢與爆炸防護。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/wood.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>骷髏盔甲</h1>\n<p>曾經想把敵人變成盔甲嗎？大概沒有，但這裡有一套輕量級的骷髏盔甲。它能讓你移動更快，凋零盔甲甚至更強。骷髏不再攻擊你。任何試圖觸碰你的東西都會受到傷害！</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/skeleton.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>神聖盔甲</h1>\n<p>想要與眾不同？來吧，這套華麗的金紅色盔甲。隨意為布料染上你喜歡的顏色。除了美觀且擁有卓越的防護力，整套神聖盔甲每分鐘能完全抵擋一次攻擊！</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/divine.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>重型盔甲</h1>\n<p>高護甲、高韌性，幾乎沒有擊退效果，但代價是機動性降低。這套盔甲專為碾壓最強敵人而設計。</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/heavy.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>史萊姆盔甲</h1>\n<p>好吧，我知道這看起來不像盔甲。但相信我，它有效。攻擊你的敵人會被彈開，爆炸也不會那麼痛！不過穿上它你可能會有點味道……</p>\n<img width=\"300\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=300,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/slime.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>戰士盔甲</h1>\n<p>這不只是維京盔甲，穿上它，你就是維京人！造成更多斧頭傷害，並根據每點缺失的生命值提升總體傷害。進入狂暴模式，在殘酷的近戰中屠戮敵人！</p>\n<img width=\"400\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/warrior.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>長袍盔甲</h1>\n<p>蓬鬆、可染色的羊毛盔甲。注入烈焰棒，讓任何攻擊你的敵人受到火焰傷害！哦，而且它還防火。因為烈焰棒。科學！</p>\n<img width=\"600\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/robe.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>蒸氣龐克盔甲</h1>\n<p>旋轉的齒輪、黃銅、指南針、時鐘，還有很多煙霧。讓我為你介紹最複雜的盔甲套裝——蒸氣龐克盔甲。頭盔配備了潛行時啟動的敵方雷達系統。胸甲提供了增強型 GUI，讓你從此不再忘記時間！護腿裝備了二段跳功能，靴子則憑藉內置的蒸氣噴射器完全防止摔落傷害。</p>\n<img width=\"500\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/steampunk.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>海磷石盔甲</h1>\n<p>利用守衛者的尖刺為自己所用！這套帶刺的盔甲會對攻擊者造成尖刺傷害。堅硬的岩石雖然讓你行動遲緩，但也提供了深海漫遊效果。</p>\n<img width=\"450\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/prismarine.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>影片評測！</h1>\n<p style=\"display:block;font-size: 16px; text-align: center;font-family: 'book antiqua', palatino, serif;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kuGRRFDy7vY?wmode=transparent\"\nheight=\"480\" width=\"872\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\n<h1>如何製作？</h1>\n<p>\n所有物品都整合到了原版配方書中（以及 JEI 等模組）。骨頭、鐵方塊、海磷碎片、羊毛、史萊姆、活塞、皮革盔甲、長袍、凋零骷髏頭顱和木材是解鎖配方所需的物品。\n</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_armors%3A.%2A&dependencies=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FLuke100000%2FImmersiveArmors%2Ftree%2F1.20.1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方圖片\"/></p></p>\n\n<h1>翻譯</h1>\n<p>\nImmersive Armors 已透過機器翻譯成多種語言，但由於品質參差不齊，歡迎你透過\n<a href=\"https://crowdin.com/project/immersive-collection\">Crowdin</a> 參與翻譯工作。\n<br/>\n對於品質不佳的翻譯，歡迎投下負評並提交你的版本。\n</p>\n\n<h1>不相容</h1>\n<p>Epic Fight 模組（盔甲將使用不美觀的備用方案）</p>\n<p>嘗試以降低透明度渲染盔甲的模組</p>\n\n<h1>整合</h1>\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hostile-humans\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Hostile%20Humans&description=為你的世界添加帶有結構的敵對人類&icon_url=https%3A//media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/586/64/64/638160491085728200.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Hostile Humans\"/>\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>Immersive Collection</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-armors\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Armors&description=大量獨特且忠於原版的盔甲套裝。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Armors\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-aircraft\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Aircraft&description=一系列樸實的飛行器，用於旅行、運輸和探索！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Aircraft\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-melodies\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Melodies&description=在各種樂器上演奏自訂旋律，煩擾你的朋友！&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Melodies\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-paintings\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Paintings&description=拖放、像素化並懸掛美麗的藝術品。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Paintings\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-optimization\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Optimization&description=一個輕量級的實體刻排程器，可使你的 TPS 翻倍。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Optimization\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/selectivebounds\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=在不相關時隱藏難看的方塊選擇輪廓。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"SelectiveBounds\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/man-of-many-planes\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man%20of%20Many%20Planes&description=一組為 Immersive Aircraft 設計的額外飛行器，並考慮了 Create 支援。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Man of Many Planes\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-machinery\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Machinery&description=一系列樸實的機械，用於運輸、採礦和自動化。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Machinery\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-furniture\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Furniture&description=在遊戲中創建自訂精美家具，或從龐大的線上圖書館中選擇。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Furniture\"/>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/immersive-gateways\">\n<img width=\"275\"\nsrc=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive%20Gateways&description=散落在主世界各地的神祕、久遠被遺忘的傳送門。&icon_url=https%3A//cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=16181c\"\nalt=\"Immersive Gateways\"/>\n</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>不喜歡顏色嗎？有些盔甲套裝是可以染色的！</p>\n<img width=\"700\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=700,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/dyeable.jpg\"\nalt=\"截圖\"/>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/nostalgia-shader\">\n截圖中的光影是 Nostalgia Shader\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"分隔線\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n</div>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=1c6d81e57aac0f3dfbd4c31c7e6b7ae7\" alt=\"頁面雜湊值，用於更方便的頁面部署。\"/>",
